      "start_seconds": 6.57,
      "end_seconds": 13.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "right good afternoon doctor. I look after them so so I thought I'd come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.28,
      "end_seconds": 22.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Is it your first time here?"
    },
