      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.36,
      "end_seconds": 194.75,
      "duration_seconds": 16.39,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate, for five years. Asthma, for five years. It's the not knowing that gets to me. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
